      "description": "业务状态。\n枚举值:\n  - DRAFT: 草稿\n  - PUBLISH_DEVELOPING: 发布待审批\n  - PUBLISHED: 已发布\n  - OFFLINE_DEVELOPING: 下线待审批\n  - OFFLINE: 已下线\n  - REJECT: 已驳回",
